[207.982205, "i", "cat <<'EOF' > /sas/handoff/change-ticket.md\n# CHANGE TICKET CHG-1943 (RECONCILED)\n\n> Reconciled change ticket updated following forensic investigation of `/disk` and threat intelligence correlation from `/sas`.\n\n| # | Action | Target | Status | Note |\n|---|--------|--------|--------|------|\n| 1 | Block source IP inbound | 198.51.100.102 | proposed | RECONCILED: Corrected IP from 203.0.113.9 to actual attacker IP 198.51.100.102 (`/disk/var/log/auth.log:222`, `/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10`) |\n| 2 | Restrict/Secure Docker API | 0.0.0.0:2375 -> 127.0.0.1:2375 (or TLS) | proposed | RECONCILED: Replaced irrelevant BlueKeep CVE item with Docker API hardening (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`, `/sas/baseline.json`) |\n| 3 | Quarantine cron miner job | /etc/cron.d/docker-mon | OPEN | RECONCILED: Downgraded status from DONE to OPEN; job file still present on disk (`/disk/cron.d/docker-mon:5`, `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`) |\n| 4 | Quarantine silent systemd unit | /etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service | proposed | RECONCILED: Added silent persistence service missed by initial shift (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`) |\n| 5 | Quarantine miner executable | /opt/xmrig/xmrig | proposed | RECONCILED: Added silent/alerted payload binary for quarantine (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:3`, `/sas/alerts.json`) |\n| 6 | Remove container overlay entrypoint residue | /var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh | proposed | RECONCILED: Added container entrypoint override residue (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`) |\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n- [x] Every action maps to a cited artifact under /disk or /sas\n- [x] Fix the wrong IP (row 1) and wrong CVE (row 2)\n- [x] Downgrade row 3 from DONE to VERIFIED-or-OPEN with evidence\n- [x] Add the silent (non-alerted) artifacts the prior shift missed\nEOF\n"]
