[221.427912, "i", "cat <<'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Summary\n- Host: `docker-prod-01`\n- Operating System: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (`/disk/etc/os-release:1`)\n- Scenario: Unauthenticated Docker API exposed externally, leading to container deployment, host escape, cryptomining payload drop, and persistence setup (cron + systemd).\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n| Timestamp (UTC) | Event Description | Evidence Source / Citation |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2026-08-23 00:53-00:55 | SSH Brute Force & Login Activity from Attacker IP | `/disk/var/log/auth.log:167-222` |\n| 2026-08-23 03:11-03:13 | Attacker Web Scanning / Exploit Probes (Log4Shell, Struts2, Shell upload) | `/disk/var/log/nginx/access.log:379-381` |\n| 2026-08-23 03:20 | Incident Intake & EDR High-Severity Alert Cluster | `/sas/handoff/intake.pdf:1` |\n| 2026-08-23 03:43 | Docker Baseline Scan detecting exposed Docker API | `/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:111-118`, `/sas/baseline.json:1` |\n| 2026-08-23 Ongoing | Mining process `xmrig` execution | `/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:3`, `/sas/alerts.json:1` |\n| 2026-08-23 Ongoing | Cron Persistence active | `/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`, `/sas/alerts.json:2` |\n| 2026-08-23 Ongoing | Systemd Persistence active (Silent finding) | `/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5` |\n| 2026-08-23 Ongoing | Container Overlay Entrypoint Residue (Silent finding) | `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3` |\n\n## Working Checklist\n\n- [x] Initial Triage & Evidence Collection (`/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`)\n- [x] Review Analyst Threat Advisory & Intel (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\n- [x] Mount & Inspect Forensic Disk Copy (`/disk`)\n- [x] Identify Attack Vector & Entry Mechanism (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`)\n- [x] Analyze Cryptominer Artifacts (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:3`, `/sas/alerts.json:1`)\n- [x] Identify Alerted Persistence Mechanisms (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`)\n- [x] Identify Silent Persistence & Residue Artifacts (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`, `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`)\n- [x] Reconcile Pre-filled Change Ticket CHG-1943 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md:1`)\n- [x] Draft Analysis Reports (`/app/intrusion-report.md`, `/app/vuln-report.md`, `/app/baseline-report.md`, `/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
