[238.26159, "o", "An external threat actor originating from IP `198.51.100.102` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt:10`, `/disk/var/log/auth.log:222`) compromised the host `docker-prod-01` by exploiting an unauthenticated Docker Engine API exposed on `0.0.0.0:2375` (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`). The attacker deployed a privileged container mounting the root filesystem, performed container escape to the host (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`), dropped an `XMRig` cryptomining payload at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:3`), and installed multiple persistence mechanisms including cron (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`) and a silent systemd service (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`)."]
