[264.699317, "o", "> "]
[264.699352, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[264.69938, "o", "> "]
[264.699535, "o", "### Weakness 2: Unrestricted Container Privileges and Host Directory Mounting\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.699574, "o", "- **Severity:** HIGH\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.699782, "o", "- **Description:** The Docker Engine API configuration and default container runtime settings allow containers to run with `--privileged` flags or bind-mount sensitive host directories (e.g. `/` or `/etc`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.699871, "o", "- **Impact:** Facilitates container escape (MITRE ATT&CK T1611) directly to host root context.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.699966, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`    \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[264.699993, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.70004, "o", "### Weakness 3: Permissive SSH Password Authentication & Root Login\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.700064, "o", "- **Severity:** MEDIUM"]
[264.700156, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.700326, "o", "- **Configuration Path:** System SSH Daemon configuration / `/var/log/auth.log`    \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.700674, "o", "- **Description:** The host permitted password-based authentication for the `root` account over SSH, resulting in brute force attempts and successful password authentication from external IP `198.51.100.102`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.700801, "o", "- **Evidence Citation:** `/disk/var/log/auth.log:167-222`    \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[264.70081, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.700918, "o", "## 3. Recommended Baseline Hardening Rules\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.701175, "o", "1. Rebind Docker API to `127.0.0.1:2375` or unix socket `/var/run/docker.sock`. If remote access is required, enforce TLS authentication on port 2376 (`/disk/etc/docker/daemon.json:116`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.701392, "o", "2. Disable SSH root login (`PermitRootLogin no`) and enforce SSH key-based authentication (`PasswordAuthentication no`) (`/disk/var/log/auth.log:222`)."]
[264.70142, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[264.701658, "o", "3. Deploy Docker daemon security profiles (AppArmor / Seccomp / SELinux) to restrict mounting host root directories within containers (`/disk/var/lib/docker/overlay2/attacker/diff/entrypoint.sh:3`)."]
[264.701678, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[264.701754, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
